        {
          "id": 786019610,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> I think it would be good to include the code generator in the tools folder and maintain it there to make it easy to regenerate the dissectors should the need arise.\n\nI'm fine with that.\n\nThe generator currently has 1100 lines or so, is written in Python 3 and has no external dependencies. It consists of 2 files, where the second one just includes a few utility functions. However, when including it in the Wireshark repository it probably makes sense to merge those functions back into the main source file.\n\nSo I'll update this pull request with that generator placed in the tools sub-directory.",
